ree suppliers, but gives no supplier-specific sourcing or capacity data; without a deal, demand is bought at the fallback price, so relative dependence cannot be established.'], 'leverage': ['On-time delivery fell from 85.7% in 2025Q4 to 80.8% in 2026Q3, supporting a push for better terms.', 'Defects were high in every reported quarter (1,214–1,997 ppm), another basis to seek improved terms.', 'The next-12-month forecast rose from 450 units in 2026-03 to 2,390 in 2026-09, giving the supplier a larger potential opportunity.']}}
